        "a covered entity must obtain an authorization for any use or disclosure of protected health information for marketing, except if the communication is in the form of:",
        "A promotional gift of nominal value provided by the covered entity."
      ],
      "rationale": "The provision defines promotional gifts of nominal value as an exception to the requirement in C0000 to obtain an authorization for marketing uses or disclosures. Adding the qualification link to C0000 and filling applies_to is directly supported by the text and resolves the qualification target defect.",
